# Whitelist: deny everything, then re-allow only the files the site needs.
# This keeps `COPY .` in the Dockerfile safe by construction, so no future
# .env, credential or local config can leak into the published web root.
*

# Web server config, copied to /etc/nginx by the Dockerfile.
!nginx.conf

# Site files.
!index.html
!styles.css
!src/
